  "ReviewNotes": [
    "Reviewed all three source diffs and exact cold analysis. The declared four implementation DownValues and recomputed loader are the only changes to8293 existing symbols. All checkers, reducers, local vertex matchers, contact calibration, models, numerical runtime and public options/defaults/messages remain unchanged.",
    "The cubic source adds only two massive Dirac endpoints, one declared massless-vector helicity and two scalars. The old four-massive-fermion/scalar admission is preserved. Every used cubic, ordered graph, pole and fermion flow remains certified by the unchanged helpers. Declared photon plus/minus weights minus/plus2 agree with the unchanged polarization converter.",
    "The colored extension requires exactly one fundamental Dirac pair and singlet bosons. A tagged whole-path abort rejects every unsupported vertex or path. Every colored edge belongs to one open fundamental fermion path, with no internal adjoint or loop. Every exact diagram color vector equals the canonical delta, with unit coordinates and Gram3; no normalization is sampled or fitted.",
    "Only certified color metadata are stripped in local model copies. Original operator rows and parameter/function ownership stay identical. Original/lifted ordered graph signatures are matched back to every original colored graph before reattaching its delta. Original model hashes and external labels/masses are retained.",
    "Completed-pair preparation uses external identities only and honors explicit reference policies and the shared remaining clock. Source construction precedes the independent benchmark. The full common projection includes all original diagrams, original targets, complete Feynman pairs and candidate; a rank2 benchmark-only direction is rejected. Accepted candidates pass every unchanged native check at all three assignments; rejected candidates retain original data and fallback.",
    "No saved answer, independent benchmark coupling, numerical fit, internal-shell condition or independent new contact constructs a proposal. Five helpers are private with only Options90 and its exact mechanical DefaultValues. New portable workflow/path controls pass, the two actual production default calls pass, and the fresh unchanged-expression equal-mass probe passes13/13. Historical continuity is not a constructor/validation rerun claim."
  ],
